## Interface: 16001
## Title: QuestThread
## Notes: See a quest's whole chain with status, total XP, reputation and item rewards, from QuestieDB. Chain button in the quest log or on the minimap, Ctrl+click a Questie map icon, or /qthread. A Zones tab and a map panel list the quests that start in each zone.
